<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61993" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάρυγξ</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υγγος</span>, ὁ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>larynx</i> or <i>upper part of the windpipe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				493a6
			</span></i>; used in sounding the vowels, ib.<i><span class="en">
				535a32
			</span></i>: but in Poets confused with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρυγξ</span> (gullet) (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				535a29
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				158
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρεῖν κατὰ τοῦ λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					108.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Crobyl.
				8
			</span></i>; of gluttons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνόσιοι λάρυγγες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					139
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ λ. ἐκκρεμάσας τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					1363
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν λάρυγγ᾽ ἂν ἐκτέμοιμί σου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					575
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. γλυκύς</span>
			<i>speech</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				6.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραχεῖα ἀρτηρία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Meno
				<u>Iatr.</u>
				8.30
			</span></i>.</div>
